# Agadir MedPort — broker ACL.
#
# Anonymous clients (the public facing default) may read all agadir/#
# and $CTF/# telemetry and may publish commands to crane / gate, but
# CANNOT publish to the ops admin namespace. That namespace is
# reserved for the "opsadmin" user whose credentials live in an
# unfortunately retained briefing message. Oops.

# --- anonymous / default ---
topic read $CTF/#
topic read agadir/#
topic write agadir/quay/+/cmd
topic write agadir/gate/+/cmd

# --- simulator (internal publisher) ---
user simulator
topic readwrite $CTF/#
topic readwrite agadir/#

# --- ops admin (privileged) ---
user opsadmin
topic read agadir/#
topic readwrite agadir/admin/#
